  "description": "Boundaries should be considered as \u2018fuzzy\u2019 rather than definitive to reflect the transitional nature of wild land. It is an update and replacement to the previously published Core Areas of Wild Land (CAWL) produced in 2013. Note that the areas have been renumbered sequentially and differ from those on the CAWL map.\u00a0\n\nFor more information visit\u00a0https://www.nature.scot/professional-advice/landscape-change/landscape-policy-and-guidance/landscape-policy-wild-land\n\nComplete metadata record on spatialdata.gov.scot",
